{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A birthday turns deadly, and the truth is buried beneath layers of secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Scarlet Enigma, you take on the role of a rookie detective navigating a tangled web of lies, timelines, and unanswered questions. A young woman is murdered during what should have been a joyful celebration, and it\u2019s up to you to uncover what really happened, before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615950/extras/16.gif?t=1742984957\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a richly detailed world where your decisions drive the investigation. Question dozens of unique characters, piece together clues, solve puzzles, and dive into interactive environments that reward curiosity and intuition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're chasing leads, uncovering betrayals, or decoding the past, every step brings you closer to the killer and deeper into a case that may not be as straightforward as it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615950/extras/12.gif?t=1742984957\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A story-driven, non-horror murder mystery with time-twisting elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Open-ended investigation\u2014approach suspects and clues in the order you choose</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">30+ original characters with custom art and individual backstories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hand-painted environments and immersive scenes to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interactive notebook to track your findings and theories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Puzzles and logic challenges that test your detective skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roughly 2\u20133 hours of gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615950/extras/14.gif?t=1742984957\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3615950?t=1742984957","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3615950?t=1742984957","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615950/fa4f5e97b8de54c9a97c62be0d2f67951d4e0caf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742984957","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615950/fa4f5e97b8de54c9a97c62be0d2f67951d4e0caf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742984957","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A birthday turns deadly, and the truth is buried beneath layers of secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Scarlet Enigma, you take on the role of a rookie detective navigating a tangled web of lies, timelines, and unanswered questions. A young woman is murdered during what should have been a joyful celebration, and it\u2019s up to you to uncover what really happened, before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615950/extras/16.gif?t=1742984957\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a richly detailed world where your decisions drive the investigation. Question dozens of unique characters, piece together clues, solve puzzles, and dive into interactive environments that reward curiosity and intuition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're chasing leads, uncover